        <briefdescription>
<para>Evaluate all adaptive rules against <computeroutput>metrics</computeroutput>. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>For each rule whose condition is satisfied, the corresponding field in a copy of <computeroutput>current_config</computeroutput> is adjusted by the rule&apos;s delta. The modified copy is returned; the original is never mutated.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>current_config</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Config snapshot to start from. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>metrics</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Current monitoring metrics. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>Updated config (unchanged if no rules triggered, or if <computeroutput>threshold_auto_adjust</computeroutput> is false). </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
