        <type>bool</type>
        <definition>bool themis::training::SelfImprovementModule::needsRollback</definition>
        <argsstring>(const DataSelectionMetrics &amp;metrics) const</argsstring>
        <name>needsRollback</name>
        <qualifiedname>themis::training::SelfImprovementModule::needsRollback</qualifiedname>
        <param>
          <type>const <ref refid="structthemis_1_1training_1_1_data_selection_metrics" kindref="compound">DataSelectionMetrics</ref> &amp;</type>
          <declname>metrics</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Decide whether the current metrics warrant a rollback. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Returns true when any of the following holds:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><computeroutput>training_accuracy</computeroutput> has dropped by more than <computeroutput>accuracy_rollback_threshold</computeroutput> relative to a baseline of 1.0 – i.e. <computeroutput>(1.0 - metrics.training_accuracy) &gt; accuracy_rollback_threshold</computeroutput></para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>avg_quality_score &lt; min_avg_quality_score</computeroutput></para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>diversity_monitoring</computeroutput> is true and <computeroutput>diversity_score &lt; min_diversity_score</computeroutput></para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Always returns false when <computeroutput>enabled</computeroutput> is false.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>metrics</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Current monitoring snapshot. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
