    <briefdescription>
<para>Applies adaptive threshold adjustment rules to a <ref refid="struct_lo_r_a_data_selection_config" kindref="compound">LoRADataSelectionConfig</ref> based on observed monitoring metrics. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Intended usage (e.g., from a background thread or scheduler): <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal"><ref refid="classthemis_1_1training_1_1_self_improvement_module_1a02fef5261ba139c13fb5e90fdb305926" kindref="member">SelfImprovementModule</ref><sp/>module(si_config);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">DataSelectionMetrics<sp/>m;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">m.avg_quality_score<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>=<sp/>0.55;<sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>below<sp/>0.60<sp/>threshold</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">m.inference_latency_ms<sp/>=<sp/>4200;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">LoRADataSelectionConfig<sp/>updated<sp/>=<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">module</highlight><highlight class="normal">.applyAdaptiveRules(current_cfg,<sp/>m);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">pipeline.setConfig(updated);<sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>live-reload</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
